d=\"1-1-7-3-2-3\" data-name=\"product weight and sensor status line\">24 g · skin temperature</p></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"slide-num absolute left-[72px] bottom-9 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4\" data-name=\"slide 5 position counter\">05 — 05</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pt-32\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"band lineup section\" id=\"lineup\">\n<div class=\"lineup-header px-[72px] pb-16 grid grid-cols-[1fr_1.45fr_1fr] gap-8 items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"lineup header with title and controls\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"lineup intro column\">\n<span class=\"lineup-eyebrow block text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] uppercase text-[#6B7B4E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"lineup eyebrow label\"><span class=\"text-[#C8553D]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow sparkle accent\">✦</span>  2026 · Band index</span>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#4A2A33] max-w-[330px]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"lineup note paragraph\" data-reason=\"innerHTML replaced by renderTop script on mode change\" id=\"lineNote\">Every band runs the same Aero Fit app, coaching and Recovery scores. Buy one outright and add a membership any time.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"lineup-title serif text-[132px] leading-[0.86] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"lineup main headline\">Five bands,<br data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/><span class=\"italic text-[#C8553D]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"headline italic accent span\">one app.</span></h2>\n<div class=\"lineup-meta flex flex-col items-end gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"lineup purchase-mode controls column\">\n<div class=\"h-12 p-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#EFEAE6] flex text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"purchase mode toggle group\">\n<button class=\"modeBtn h-10 px-5 rounded-full transition bg-[#2A0B14] text-white\" data-act=\"mode\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-1-1\" data-mode=\"out\" data-name=\"buy outright mode button\" data-reason=\"class toggled by renderTop script based on mode\">Buy outright</button>\n<button class=\"modeBtn h-10 px-5 rounded-full transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-act=\"mode\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-1-2\" data-mode=\"mem\" data-name=\"with membership mode button\" data-reason=\"class toggled by renderTop script based on mode\">With membership</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden items-center gap-2 text-[13px]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"membership plan row\" data-reason=\"children rendered and innerHTML replaced by renderTop script\" id=\"planRow\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 pr-4\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"lineup band card list container\" data-reason=\"children rendered by renderStrips script on every render\" id=\"strips\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-[72px] mt-14 pt-10 border-t border-[#2A0B14]/10 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"lineup compare footer bar\">\n<a class=\"lineup-link serif text-[30px] font-medium flex items-center gap-4 hover:gap-6 transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"compare all five link\" href=\"#compare\">Compare all five <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[26px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"relative mx-4 mt-32 h-[880px] rounded-[28px] overflow-hidden bg-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"quiz section to find your band\" id=\"quiz\">\n<div class=\"absolute z-10 top-14 left-[72px] right-[72px] flex items-center justify-between pointer-events-none text-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"quiz top overlay labels\" data-reason=\"color style set by stage-change script\" id=\"quizOverlay\">\n<span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.34em] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"quiz label find your band\">✦  Find your band · three questions</span>\n<span class=\"serif italic text-[24px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"quiz result summary italic line\">Two bands worth comparing.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute z-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 right-10 flex flex-col items-end gap-4 text-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"quiz stage progress dots\" data-reason=\"style color set by stage-change script\" id=\"quizProg\">\n<button class=\"prog-dot active serif text-[20px] font-medium\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"quiz stage 01 progress dot\" data-reason=\"active class and opacity/transform toggled by goStage script\" data-stage=\"0\">01</button>\n<button class=\"prog-dot serif text-[20px] font-medium\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"quiz stage 02 progress dot\" data-reason=\"active class and opacity/transform toggled by goStage script\" data-stage=\"1\">02</button>\n<button class=\"prog-dot serif text-[20px] font-medium\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"quiz stage 03 progress dot\" data-reason=\"active class and opacity/transform toggled by goStage script\" data-stage=\"2\">03</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"quiz stage slides container\">\n<article class=\"stage stage-active absolute inset-0 bg-[#F8F38A] text-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"quiz stage 1 use-for question\" data-reason=\"stage-active class toggled by goStage script which drives bar-fill transform\">\n<span class=\"absolute top-[108px] left-[56px] serif text-[340px] leading-[0.78] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 giant background number\">01<span class=\"text-[60px] align-top ml-3 opacity-50 tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 number denominator\">/03</span></span>\n<div class=\"absolute right-[150px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"stage 1 question text block\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 question label\">Question 1 of 3</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 serif text-[72px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stage 1 question headline\">What will you use it for most?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] max-w-[400px] opacity-80\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"stage 1 question description\">Pick the one that fills most of your week. Battery is usually the deciding row.</p>\n<div class=\"qopts mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-k=\"use\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"stage 1 question option buttons\" data-reason=\"buttons rendered by renderQuiz script on every render\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[72px] bottom-[120px] w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3\" data-name=\"stage 1 battery life chart\">\n<p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] uppercase opacity-60 mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 chart caption\">Battery life, in days</p>\n<div class=\"flex items-end gap-4 h-[150px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"stage 1 battery bar chart\">\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Lite battery bar column\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Lite battery bar\" style=\"--h:.36\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"stage 1 Smart battery bar column\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Smart battery bar\" data-reason=\"scaleY set to --h value when stage-active class applied by goStage\" style=\"--h:.5\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"stage 1 Pro battery bar column\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Pro battery bar\" data-reason=\"scaleY set to --h value when stage-active class applied by goStage\" style=\"--h:.71\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"stage 1 Music battery bar column\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Music battery bar\" data-reason=\"scaleY set to --h value when stage-active class applied by goStage\" style=\"--h:.43\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"stage 1 Ultra battery bar column\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#C8553D]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Ultra battery bar\" data-reason=\"scaleY set to --h value when stage-active class applied by goStage\" style=\"--h:1\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"stage 1 battery number labels\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Lite days label\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Lite days number\">5</span>Lite</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"stage 1 Smart days label\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Smart days number\">7</span>Smart</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"stage 1 Pro days label\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Pro days number\">10</span>Pro</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-4\" data-name=\"stage 1 Music days label\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-4-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Music days number\">6</span>Music</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-5\" data-name=\"stage 1 Ultra days label\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-3-3-5-1\" data-name=\"stage 1 Ultra days number\">14</span>Ultra</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"stage absolute inset-0 bg-[#C8553D] text-[#FAF8F6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"quiz stage 2 overnight question\">\n<span class=\"absolute top-[108px] left-[56px] serif text-[340px] leading-[0.78] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 giant background number\">02<span class=\"text-[60px] align-top ml-3 opacity-50 tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 number denominator\">/03</span></span>\n<div class=\"absolute right-[150px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"stage 2 question text block\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 question label\">Question 2 of 3</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 serif text-[72px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"stage 2 question headline\">How do you feel about wearing it overnight?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] max-w-[400px] opacity-85\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"stage 2 question description\">Sleep stages need it on your wrist all night. Every gram counts at 3 am.</p>\n<div class=\"qopts mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"stage 2 question option buttons\" data-reason=\"buttons rendered by renderQuiz script on every render\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[72px] bottom-[110px] flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3\" data-name=\"stage 2 weight gauge and list\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-[230px] h-[230px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 weight gauge SVG\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"none\" r=\"42\" stroke=\"rgba(250,248,246,0.22)\" stroke-width=\"9\"></circle>\n<circle class=\"gauge-fg\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"none\" r=\"42\" stroke=\"#FAF8F6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"9\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#FAF8F6\" style=\"font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"50\" y=\"52\">18 g</text>\n<text fill=\"#FAF8F6\" opacity=\".7\" style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:6.5px;letter-spacing:1.4px\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"50\" y=\"65\">LIGHTEST BAND</text>\n</svg>\n<ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[14px] w-[220px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"stage 2 band weight list\">\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 Lite weight row\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 Lite band name\">Lite</span><span class=\"serif text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"stage 2 Lite weight value\">18 g</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"stage 2 Smart weight row\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 Smart band name\">Smart</span><span class=\"serif text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"stage 2 Smart weight value\">24 g</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"stage 2 Pro weight row\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"stage 2 Pr